# This project deploys as a Cloudflare Worker with static assets (not
# classic Cloudflare Pages), and that product's _redirects format only
# accepts relative paths — a cross-host rule like "www -> apex domain"
# is rejected at deploy time with "Only relative URLs are allowed".
#
# If you ever add www.ironwoodlivigno.com as a second custom domain and
# want it to redirect to the bare domain, set that up instead as a
# Redirect Rule at the Cloudflare zone level: dash.cloudflare.com ->
# your domain -> Rules -> Redirect Rules -> Create rule. That works
# regardless of Workers vs Pages and doesn't need anything in this file.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
