# Those pages were indexed by search engines and linked from old
# navigation menus; without these rules they 404 and any accumulated
# link equity is lost. 301 = permanent, tells Google to transfer the
# old URL's standing to the new destination.
# Note: static files always win over redirects on Cloudflare, so these
# only fire for URLs that no longer exist.
